    "GitHub 单个文件上限 100 MB。请将大文件移出仓库、压缩拆分，或使用 Git LFS。若大文件已被提交，需要先在 GitHub Desktop 中撤销该提交。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GitHub limits single files to 100 MB. Move large files out of the repository, compress or split them, or use Git LFS. If a large file was already committed, undo that commit in GitHub Desktop first."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GitHub 单个文件上限 100 MB。请将大文件移出仓库、压缩拆分，或使用 Git LFS。若大文件已被提交，需要先在 GitHub Desktop 中撤销该提交。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
