    "「%@」不是「%@」这个仓库：远程地址和提交记录都对不上。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” isn't the repository “%@”: neither its remote URL nor its commits match."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」不是「%@」这个仓库：远程地址和提交记录都对不上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」位于仓库内部，已改为添加仓库根目录：%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” is inside a repository; its root folder was added instead: %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」位于仓库内部，已改为添加仓库根目录：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」保留本地版本，远程版本另存为「%@」。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@”: kept the local version; the remote version was saved as “%@”."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」保留本地版本，远程版本另存为「%@」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」到 %@ 的版本": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” to the version of %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」到 %@ 的版本"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」在废纸篓中": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” is in the Trash"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」在废纸篓中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」大小 %@，接近 GitHub 100 MB 限制，上传可能较慢。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” is %@, close to GitHub's 100 MB limit; uploading may be slow."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」大小 %@，接近 GitHub 100 MB 限制，上传可能较慢。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」大小 %@，超过上传上限 %@，已跳过（文件保留在本地）。建议移出仓库或使用 Git LFS。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” is %@, over the upload limit of %@, so it was skipped (the file stays local). Move it out of the repository or use Git LFS."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」大小 %@，超过上传上限 %@，已跳过（文件保留在本地）。建议移出仓库或使用 Git LFS。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」已经在列表中。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” is already in the list."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」已经在列表中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」已经是列表中的「%@」。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” is already in the list as “%@”."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」已经是列表中的「%@」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」有未完成的%@，需要先处理才能同步。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” has an unfinished %@ that must be handled before syncing."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」有未完成的%@，需要先处理才能同步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」没有配置远程 origin，请先在 GitHub Desktop 中发布（Publish）后再同步。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” has no origin remote. Publish it in GitHub Desktop first, then sync."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」没有配置远程 origin，请先在 GitHub Desktop 中发布（Publish）后再同步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」的远程不是 GitHub（%@），将使用系统凭据进行同步。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The remote of “%@” is not GitHub (%@); system credentials will be used to sync."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」的远程不是 GitHub（%@），将使用系统凭据进行同步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「保留两者」：本地版本保持原名，远程版本另存为「文件名 (远程版本 日期).扩展名」——推荐，不会丢失任何内容。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“Keep Both”: the local version keeps its name and the remote version is saved as “name (Remote version date).ext” — recommended, nothing is lost."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「保留两者」：本地版本保持原名，远程版本另存为「文件名 (远程版本 日期).扩展名」——推荐，不会丢失任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「保留本地」/「使用远程」：另一方的版本仍保存在 Git 历史中，并会创建备份引用，可以恢复。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“Keep Local” / “Use Remote”: the other version stays in Git history and a backup ref is created, so it can be restored."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「保留本地」/「使用远程」：另一方的版本仍保存在 Git 历史中，并会创建备份引用，可以恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
