    "仓库已经比较大。经常修改的大文件（视频、大型 PPT、安装包等）建议移出这个文件夹，放到不同步的位置，可以减缓历史继续增长。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This repository is getting large. Consider moving large, frequently edited files (videos, big PPT files, installers) out of this folder to slow the growth of its history."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
