    "使用 GitHub CLI 登录时，在终端执行下面的命令授权一次，然后回到这里再点删除。使用个人访问令牌时，经典令牌需勾选 delete_repo，细粒度令牌需授予 Administration 读写。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If you sign in with GitHub CLI, run the command below in Terminal once, then come back and click Delete. With a personal access token, classic tokens need delete_repo and fine-grained tokens need Administration read and write."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 GitHub CLI 登录时，在终端执行下面的命令授权一次，然后回到这里再点删除。使用个人访问令牌时，经典令牌需勾选 delete_repo，细粒度令牌需授予 Administration 读写。"
          }
        }
      }
