    "共 %lld 个文件会改变。未同步的本地修改会先保存进历史，并创建备份；恢复作为一次新的同步上传，之后仍可在历史中回到现在的状态。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%lld file will change. Unsynced local edits are saved to history first and a backup is created; the restore is uploaded as a new sync, so you can still go back to the current state later."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%lld files will change. Unsynced local edits are saved to history first and a backup is created; the restore is uploaded as a new sync, so you can still go back to the current state later."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "共 %lld 个文件会改变。未同步的本地修改会先保存进历史，并创建备份；恢复作为一次新的同步上传，之后仍可在历史中回到现在的状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "共 %lld 个文件变更：": {
      "localizations": {
