            "state": "translated",
            "value": "另存副本"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只会从 GitSync 中移除，不会删除本地文件，也不会影响 GitHub 上的仓库。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This only removes it from GitSync. Local files and the GitHub repository are not affected."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只会从 GitSync 中移除，不会删除本地文件，也不会影响 GitHub 上的仓库。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可以选已发布到 GitHub 的仓库，也可以选普通文件夹（将在 GitHub 上创建新仓库）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose a repository already published to GitHub, or a plain folder (a new GitHub repository will be created)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可以选已发布到 GitHub 的仓库，也可以选普通文件夹（将在 GitHub 上创建新仓库）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可能是 GitHub Desktop 等程序正在执行 Git 操作，稍后会自动重试。若确认没有任何 Git 程序在运行，可删除仓库中的 .git/index.lock。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GitHub Desktop or another program may be running a Git operation; GitSync will retry later. If no Git program is running, you can delete .git/index.lock in the repository."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可能是 GitHub Desktop 等程序正在执行 Git 操作，稍后会自动重试。若确认没有任何 Git 程序在运行，可删除仓库中的 .git/index.lock。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可能是网络过慢或文件过大。已终止该操作，没有修改任何文件。可稍后重试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The network may be slow or the files too large. The operation was stopped and no files were changed. Try again later."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可能是网络过慢或文件过大。已终止该操作，没有修改任何文件。可稍后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "右侧预览的是删除前的最后一个版本。找回后它会回到原来的位置，并作为一次新的同步上传。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The preview shows the last version before deletion. Recovering puts it back where it was and uploads it as a new sync."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "右侧预览的是删除前的最后一个版本。找回后它会回到原来的位置，并作为一次新的同步上传。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
