    "如果仓库已在 GitHub 上删除，可在「更多」中把这个文件夹重新发布到新仓库，或从列表移除。否则请确认远程地址正确，并确认登录的 GitHub 账号对该私有仓库有读写权限；使用令牌时需要 repo 权限（细粒度令牌需对该仓库授予 Contents 读写）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If the repository was deleted on GitHub, you can publish this folder to a new repository from “More”, or remove it from the list. Otherwise check that the remote URL is correct and that the signed-in GitHub account can read and write this private repository; tokens need the repo scope (fine-grained tokens need Contents read and write)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果仓库已在 GitHub 上删除，可在「更多」中把这个文件夹重新发布到新仓库，或从列表移除。否则请确认远程地址正确，并确认登录的 GitHub 账号对该私有仓库有读写权限；使用令牌时需要 repo 权限（细粒度令牌需对该仓库授予 Contents 读写）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "如果以上都未配置，GitSync 会使用系统 Git 已保存的凭据（osxkeychain / Git Credential Manager）或 SSH 密钥。所有 Git 操作都禁止交互式提示，凭据缺失时会明确报错而不是卡住。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If none of the above is set up, GitSync uses the credentials saved by system Git (osxkeychain / Git Credential Manager) or SSH keys. Interactive prompts are always disabled, so missing credentials produce a clear error instead of hanging."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果以上都未配置，GitSync 会使用系统 Git 已保存的凭据（osxkeychain / Git Credential Manager）或 SSH 密钥。所有 Git 操作都禁止交互式提示，凭据缺失时会明确报错而不是卡住。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "如果你已在其他工具中处理了冲突，可重新同步检测": {
