            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将创建 github.com/%@/%@，本地文件夹名保持「%@」不变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "将执行 git %@ --abort，仓库回到该操作开始之前的状态。该操作过程中尚未提交的冲突解决内容会丢失；已提交的内容不受影响。如不确定，请改用 GitHub Desktop 处理。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This runs git %@ --abort and returns the repository to the state before that operation. Unsaved conflict resolutions in it are lost; committed work is not affected. If unsure, use GitHub Desktop instead."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将执行 git %@ --abort，仓库回到该操作开始之前的状态。该操作过程中尚未提交的冲突解决内容会丢失；已提交的内容不受影响。如不确定，请改用 GitHub Desktop 处理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
