    "请关闭历史窗口后重新打开再试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Close the history window, open it again and retry."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请关闭历史窗口后重新打开再试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GitHub 上已有内容，但本地文件夹里有同名文件，GitSync 不会覆盖它们。请把这些文件移到别处，再点「立即同步」。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GitHub already has content, but the local folder has files with the same names, and GitSync won't overwrite them. Move those files elsewhere, then click Sync Now."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GitHub 上已有内容，但本地文件夹里有同名文件，GitSync 不会覆盖它们。请把这些文件移到别处，再点「立即同步」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请在 GitHub Desktop 中切换回一个分支（例如 main）后再同步。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Switch back to a branch (for example main) in GitHub Desktop, then sync."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请在 GitHub Desktop 中切换回一个分支（例如 main）后再同步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请在 GitHub Desktop 或终端中完成或中止该操作；也可以在「更多」菜单中选择中止（需要确认）。GitSync 不会自动清理。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Finish or abort the operation in GitHub Desktop or Terminal; you can also abort it from the “More” menu (with confirmation). GitSync never cleans up on its own."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请在 GitHub Desktop 或终端中完成或中止该操作；也可以在「更多」菜单中选择中止（需要确认）。GitSync 不会自动清理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请在 GitHub Desktop 的设置中配置 Git 名称和邮箱，或登录 GitHub 账户后重试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set your Git name and email in GitHub Desktop settings, or sign in to GitHub and try again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请在 GitHub Desktop 的设置中配置 Git 名称和邮箱，或登录 GitHub 账户后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请在「系统设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 完全磁盘访问权限 / 文件与文件夹」中允许 GitSync 访问该位置。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allow GitSync to access this location in System Settings › Privacy & Security › Full Disk Access / Files and Folders."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请在「系统设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 完全磁盘访问权限 / 文件与文件夹」中允许 GitSync 访问该位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请在「设置 › GitHub 账户」中重新登录（OAuth、GitHub CLI 或个人访问令牌）。如果使用 SSH 地址，请确认 ssh-agent 中已加载密钥。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sign in again in Settings › GitHub Account (OAuth, GitHub CLI or a personal access token). If you use an SSH URL, make sure your key is loaded in ssh-agent."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请在「设置 › GitHub 账户」中重新登录（OAuth、GitHub CLI 或个人访问令牌）。如果使用 SSH 地址，请确认 ssh-agent 中已加载密钥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请在浏览器中输入上面的验证码并授权，完成后此窗口会自动更新。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enter the code above in your browser and authorize; this window updates automatically when you're done."
