          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这个文件夹同时由 iCloud 云盘同步。iCloud 可能把文件移到云端或生成冲突副本，影响 Git；建议放到不经过 iCloud 的位置，例如个人文件夹下的 GitSync 文件夹。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This folder is also synced by iCloud Drive. iCloud may move files to the cloud or create conflict copies, which can break Git. Consider a location outside iCloud, such as a GitSync folder in your home folder."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个文件夹同时由 iCloud 云盘同步。iCloud 可能把文件移到云端或生成冲突副本，影响 Git；建议放到不经过 iCloud 的位置，例如个人文件夹下的 GitSync 文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
